==Description==
'''Gatling Gun Banned''' is a [[Modifiers|modifier]] that is only active in [[Containment]] on the Hard difficulty. It also used to appear in [[Pls Donate]] on the Hard difficulty.

==Effects==
When the '''Gatling Gun Banned''' modifier is active, the [[Gatling Gun]] will disappear from the player's loadout, rendering it useless.

==Update History==
*'''30 October 2024''' - [[v1.39.0]]
**'''Gatling Gun Banned''' added.
*'''13 November 2024''' - [[v1.41.0]]
**'''Gatling Gun Banned''' is now active in [[Pls Donate]].
*'''27 November 2024''' - [[v1.43.0]]
**'''Gatling Gun Banned''' is no longer active in [[Pls Donate]].



